---
title: Secuencia de Failover — Reconexión y Degradación
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FW as Firmware
    participant BROKER1 as Broker #1
    participant BROKER2 as Broker #2
    participant BACKEND as Backend
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note right of FW: Estado normal
        FW->>BROKER1: publish mush2/{id}/telemetry
        BROKER1-->>FW: OK
        FW->>BROKER1: publish mush2/{id}/status (ONLINE)
    end

    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
        Note right of FW: Broker #1 falla
        BROKER1--xFW: Connection lost
        FW->>FW: Detecta desconexión
        FW->>FW: NVS: offlineMode = true
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note right of FW: Reintentos con backoff
        loop Reintento 1 (5s)
            FW->>BROKER1: reconnect attempt
            BROKER1--xFW: FAIL
        end
        loop Reintento 2 (10s)
            FW->>BROKER1: reconnect attempt
            BROKER1--xFW: FAIL
        end
    end

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note right of FW: Failover a Broker #2
        FW->>BROKER2: connect
        BROKER2-->>FW: CONNECTED
        FW->>BROKER2: publish mush2/{id}/status (ONLINE, retain)
        FW->>BROKER2: subscribe mush2/{id}/actuators
        FW->>BROKER2: subscribe mush2/{id}/ota/command
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note right of FW: Reanuda operación normal
        FW->>BROKER2: publish mush2/{id}/telemetry
        FW->>BROKER2: publish mush2/{id}/health
    end

    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
        Note right of BACKEND: Backend detecta offline
        BACKEND->>DB: UPDATE devices SET connectivity='OFFLINE'
        BACKEND->>BACKEND: SSE event: device:offline
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note right of BACKEND: Firmware reconecta
        FW->>BACKEND: POST /api/v1/telemetry (reconnect)
        BACKEND->>DB: UPDATE devices SET connectivity='ONLINE'
        BACKEND->>BACKEND: SSE event: device:online
    end

    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
        Note right of FW: Modo degradado (sin red)
        Note over FW: Operación LOCAL: histéresis T/H/CO2<br/>Sin control remoto<br/>Buffer en SPIFFS para replay
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note right of FW: Safe mode (5+ reboots)
        Note over FW: EEPROM counter > 5<br/>LED rojo, espera 60s<br/>Solo WiFi, espera comando reset
    end
